category: Utils
build-depends: cygport autoconf-archive gettext-devel libintl-devel
sdesc: "Tool that dumps shared memory segments (System V and POSIX)"
ldesc: "This is a simple tool that dumps shared memory segments (System V and POSIX),
files and text. It might be useful when you have to debug programs that use
shared memory."
